r:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 15</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer Mutakallim: بَيْتِي ← فِي بَيْتِي (Page 33–34)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتِي</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Jarr + ـِي</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">فِي بَيْتِي</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتِي (Mera ghar) se فِي بَيْتِي (Mere ghar mein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 33–34):** Jab `ـِي` wale ism (`بَيْتِي`، `رَبِّي`، `صَلَاتِي`) ke shuru mein `فِي`، `مِنْ`، `إِلَىٰ`، `عَلَىٰ` ya `إِنَّ` aata hai toh chunki `ـِي` se pehle pehle hi Zair maujood hoti hai, is liye lafz ki shakl mein koi tabdeeli nahin hoti: `فِي بَيْتِي` (mere ghar mein), `إِلَىٰ رَبِّي` (mere Rabb ki taraf), `إِنَّ رَبِّي لَسَمِيعُ الدُّعَاءِ` (beshak mera Rabb dua sunne wala hai)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l15_r0","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Harf-e-Jarr (Preposition) ke baad aane wale ism mein Yaa-e Mutakallim (ي) lagane ka tariqa."}},{"id":"sec_s4l15_pair_1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":1,"arabic":"بَيْتِيْ","hinglish":"Mera ghar","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"root","arabic_suffix":"","translations":{"en":"My house","ur":"میرا گھر","hi":"मेरा घर"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>"},{"id":2,"arabic":"إِلَى بَيْتِيْ","hinglish":"Mere ghar ki taraf","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"derived","arabic_root":"بَيْتِيْ","arabic_suffix":"إِلَى ","translations":{"en":"To my house","ur":"میرے گھر کی طرف","hi":"मेरे घर की तरफ़"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَى بَيْتِيْ</span>"},{"id":3,"arabic":"رَبِّيْ","hinglish":"Mera Rabb","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"root","arabic_suffix":"","translations":{"en":"My Lord","ur":"میرا رب","hi":"मेरा रब"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>"},{"id":4,"arabic":"مِنْ رَّبِّيْ","hinglish":"Mere Rabb se","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"derived","arabic_root":" رَّبِّيْ","arabic_suffix":"مِنْ","translations":{"en":"From my Lord","ur":"میرے رب سے","hi":"मेरे रब से"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَّبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>"},{"id":5,"arabic":"رَحْمَتِيْ","hinglish":"Meri rahmat","display_mode":"paired","pai