e Rabb se","translations":{"en":"From my Lord","ur":"میرے رب سے","hi":"मेरे रब से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w6","arabic":"مِنْ رَّحْمَتِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَّحْمَتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Meri rahmat se","translations":{"en":"From my mercy","ur":"میری رحمت سے","hi":"मेरी रहमत से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w7","arabic":"مِنْ ذِكْرِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذِكْرِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere zikr se","translations":{"en":"From my remembrance","ur":"میرے ذکر سے","hi":"मेरे ज़िक्र से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w8","arabic":"مِنْ دِيْنِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دِيْنِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere deen se","translations":{"en":"From my religion","ur":"میرے دین سے","hi":"मेरे दीन से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w9","arabic":"مِنْ لِّسَانِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِّسَانِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Meri zaban se","translations":{"en":"From my tongue","ur":"میری زبان سے","hi":"मेरी ज़बान से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w10","arabic":"مِنْ رُّوْحِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رُّوْحِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Meri rooh se","translations":{"en":"Of my spirit","ur":"میری روح سے","hi":"मेरी रूह से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w11","arabic":"مِنْ ذُرِّيَّتِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذُرِّيَّتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Meri aulad se","translations":{"en":"From my offspring","ur":"میری اولاد سے","hi":"मेरी औलाद से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w12","arabic":"مِنْ أَهْلِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَهْلِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere gharane se","translations":{"en":"From my family","ur":"میرے گھرانے سے","hi":"मेरे घराने से"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w13","arabic":"فِيْ قَوْمِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Meri qom mein","translations":{"en":"Among my people","ur":"میری قوم میں","hi":"मेरी क़ौम में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w14","arabic":"فِيْ نَفْسِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَفْسِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere nafs mein","translations":{"en":"Within myself","ur":"میرے نفس میں","hi":"मेरे नफ़्स में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w15","arabic":"فِيْ ذِكْرِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذِكْرِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere zikr mein","translations":{"en":"In my remembrance","ur":"میرے ذکر میں","hi":"मेरे ज़िक्र में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w16","arabic":"فِيْ بَطْنِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَطْنِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere pet mein","translations":{"en":"In my womb","ur":"میرے پیٹ میں","hi":"मेरे पेट में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w17","arabic":"فِيْ سَبِيْلِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَبِيْلِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere raste mein","translations":{"en":"In my way","ur":"میرے راستے میں","hi":"मेरे रास्ते में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w18","arabic":"فِيْ ضَيْفِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ضَيْفِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere mehman mein","translations":{"en":"Concerning my guests","ur":"میرے مہمان میں","hi":"मेरे मेहमान में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w19","arabic":"فِيْ أَمْرِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَمْرِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Mere hukm mein","translations":{"en":"In my affair","ur":"میرے حکم میں","hi":"मेरे हुक्म में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w20","arabic":"فِيْ رُؤْيَايَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رُؤْيَا</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يَ</span>","hinglish":"Mere khawab mein","translations":{"en":"In my dream","ur":"میرے خواب میں","hi":"मेरे ख़्वाब में"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w21","arabic":"إِنَّ صَلَاتِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صَلَاتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak meri namaz","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my prayer","ur":"بیشک میری نماز","hi":"बेशक मेरी नमाज़"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w22","arabic":"إِنَّ قَوْمِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak meri qom","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my people","ur":"بیشک میری قوم","hi":"बेशक मेरी क़ौम"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w23","arabic":"إِنَّ عَذَابِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذَابِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera azab","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my punishment","ur":"بیشک میرا عذاب","hi":"बेशक मेरा अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w24","arabic":"إِنَّ أَرْضِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَرْضِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak meri zameen","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my earth","ur":"بیشک میری زمین","hi":"बेशक मेरी ज़मीन"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w25","arabic":"إِنَّ أَبِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَبِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mere baap","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my father","ur":"بیشک میرے باپ","hi":"बेशक मेरे बाप"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w26","arabic":"إِنَّ كَيْدِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كَيْدِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak meri tadbeer","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my plot","ur":"بیشک میری تدبیر","hi":"बेशक मेरी तदबीर"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w27","arabic":"إِنَّ ابْنِيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ابْنِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera beta","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my son","ur":"بیشک میرا بیٹا","hi":"बेशक मेरा बेटा"}},{"id":"s4l15_g2_w28","arabic":"إِنَّ وَلِيِّيْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِيِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">يْ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera karsaz","translations":{"en":"Indeed, my protector","ur":"بیشک میرا کارساز","hi":"बेशक मेरा कारसाज़"}}],"cols":4}},{"id":"sec_s4l15_s_lbl","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Section 3 (Page 34): فِي بَيْتِي / إِنَّ رَبِّي se Banne wali Qur'ani Aayaat (1–18)"}},{"id":"sec_s4l15_sent","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l15_sent_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"إِنَّ وَلِيِّيَ اللَّهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِيِّيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera karsaaz Allah hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا ولی (کارساز) اللہ ہے","en":"Indeed, my Protector is Allah","hi":"बेशक मेरा वली (कारसाज़) अल्लाह है"},"ref":"7:196"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"إِنَّ أَرْضِي وَاسِعَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَرْضِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاسِعَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Meri zameen kushaada hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میری زمین کشادہ ہے","en":"Indeed, My earth is spacious","hi":"बेशक मेरी ज़मीन कुशादा है"},"ref":"29:56"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي قَرِيبٌ مُجِيبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَرِيبٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُجِيبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb qareeb hai, dua qabool karne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب قریب ہے، دعا قبول کرنے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is near and responsive","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब क़रीब है, दुआ क़ुबूल करने वाला है"},"ref":"11:61"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"إِنَّ كَيْدِي مَتِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كَيْدِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Meri tadbeer badi mazboot hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میری تدبیر بڑی مضبوط ہے","en":"Indeed, My plan is firm","hi":"बेशक मेरी तदबीर बड़ी मज़बूत है"}},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"عِلْمُهَا عِنْدَ رَبِّي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمُهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span>","hinglish":"Uska ilm mere Rabb ke paas hai","translations":{"ur":"اس کا علم میرے رب کے پاس ہے","en":"Its knowledge is with my Lord","hi":"इसका इल्म मेरे रब के पास है"}},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ ابْنِي مِنْ أَهْلِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ابْنِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَهْلِي</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera beta mere ghar walon mein se hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا بیٹا میرے گھر والوں میں سے ہے","en":"Indeed, my son is of my family","hi":"बेशक मेरा बेटा मेरे घर वालों में से है"},"ref":"11:45"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي غَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَفُورٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb bakhshne wala meherbaan hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب بخشنے والا، نہایت مہربان ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is Forgiving and Merciful","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब बख़्शने वाला, निहायत मेहरबान है"},"ref":"12:53"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي لَطِيفٌ لِمَا يَشَاءُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَطِيفٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَشَاءُ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb jo chahta hai uski baareek tadbeer karne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب جو چاہتا ہے اس کی باریک تدبیر فرمانے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is Subtle in what He wills","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब जो चाहता है उसकी बारीक तदबीर फ़रमाने वाला है"},"ref":"12:100"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ رَبِّي غَنِيٌّ كَرِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَنِيٌّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كَرِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Pas beshak mera Rabb be-niyaaz, bada karam karne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"تو بیشک میرا رب بے نیاز، کریم ہے","en":"Then indeed, my Lord is Self-Sufficient and Generous","hi":"तो बेशक मेरा रब बेनियाज़, करीम है"},"ref":"27:40"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي رَحِيمٌ وَدُودٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحِيمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَدُودٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb bada meherbaan, muhabbat karne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب رحم کرنے والا، محبت کرنے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is Merciful and Affectionate","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब रहम करने वाला, मुहब्बत करने वाला है"},"ref":"11:90"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"إِنَّ عَذَابِي لَشَدِيدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذَابِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَشَدِيدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Mera azaab bada sakht hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا عذاب بہت سخت ہے","en":"Indeed, My punishment is severe","hi":"बेशक मेरा अज़ाब बहुत सख़्त है"},"ref":"14:7"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي لَغَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَغَفُورٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb zaroor bakhshne wala meherbaan hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب یقیناً بخشنے والا، نہایت مہربان ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is surely Forgiving and Merciful","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब यक़ीनन बख़्शने वाला, निहायत मेहरबान है"},"ref":"11:41"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s13","sentence_number":13,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي لَسَمِيعُ الدُّعَاءِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَسَمِيعُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّعَاءِ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb dua ka khoob sunne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب یقیناً دعا کا سننے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is the Hearer of supplication","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब यक़ीनन दुआ का सुनने वाला है"},"ref":"14:39"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s14","sentence_number":14,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ حَفِيظٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كُلِّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَفِيظٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb har cheez par nigehbaan hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب ہر چیز پر نگہبان ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is Guardian over all things","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब हर चीज़ पर निगहबान है"},"ref":"11:57"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s15","sentence_number":15,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبِّي عَلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صِرَاطٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُسْتَقِيمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mera Rabb seedhe raaste par hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرا رب سیدھے راستے پر ہے","en":"Indeed, my Lord is on a straight path","hi":"बेशक मेरा रब सीधे रास्ते पर है"},"ref":"11:56"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s16","sentence_number":16,"arabic":"عِلْمُهَا عِنْدَ رَبِّي فِي كِتَابٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمُهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابٍ</span>","hinglish":"Uska ilm mere Rabb ke paas ek Kitaab mein mahfooz hai","translations":{"ur":"اس کا علم میرے رب کے پاس ایک کتاب میں محفوظ ہے","en":"Its knowledge is with my Lord in a Record","hi":"इसका इल्म मेरे रब के पास एक किताब में महफ़ूज़ है"},"ref":"20:52"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s17","sentence_number":17,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ عَذَابِي هُوَ الْعَذَابُ الْأَلِيمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذَابِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هُوَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَذَابُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَلِيمُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh ke Mera azaab hi dardnaak azaab hai","translations":{"ur":"اور یہ کہ میرا عذاب ہی دردناک عذاب ہے","en":"And that My punishment is the painful punishment","hi":"और यह कि मेरा अज़ाब ही दर्दनाक अज़ाब है"},"ref":"15:50"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s18a","arabic":"رَبِّ / إِنَّ ابْنِي مِنْ أَهْلِي / وَإِنَّ وَعْدَكَ الْحَقُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span> / <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ابْنِي مِنْ أَهْلِي</span> / <span class=\"nonroot\">وَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعْدَكَ الْحَقُّ</span>","hinglish":"Ae mere Rabb! Beshak mera beta mere ghar walon mein se hai aur beshak Tera waada sachcha hai","translations":{"en":"My Lord, indeed my son is of my family; and indeed, Your promise is truth","ur":"اے میرے رب! بیشک میرا بیٹا میرے گھر والوں میں سے ہے اور بیشک تیرا وعدہ سچا ہے","hi":"ऐ मेरे रब! बेशक मेरा बेटा मेरे घर वालों में से है और बेशक तेरा वादा सच्चा है"},"sentence_number":18,"displayOrder":18,"ref":"11:45"},{"id":"s4l15_sent_s18","sentence_number":19,"arabic":"إِنَّ صَلَاتِي وَنُسُكِي وَمَحْيَايَ وَمَمَاتِي لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صَلَاتِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَنُسُكِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَحْيَايَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَمَاتِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِلَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَالَم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ِينَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَرِيكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak meri namaz aur meri qurbani aur mera jeena aur mera marna sab Allah ke liye hai jo tamaam jahanon ka Rabb hai, Uska koi shareek nahin","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میری نماز، میری قربانی، میرا جینا اور میرا مرنا اللہ ہی کے لیے ہے جو تمام جہانوں کا رب ہے، اس کا کوئی شریک نہیں","en":"Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds; He has no partner","hi":"बेशक मेरी नमाज़, मेरी क़ुर्बानी, मेरा जीना और मेरा मरना अल्लाह ही के लिए है जो तमाम जहानों का रब है, उसका कोई शरीक नहीं"},"displayOrder":19,"full_width":true,"ref":"6:162-163"}]}}]}}